# COPY BAR, ALL TRACKS / PASTE BAR, ALL TRACKS (Steps' SEL, the bar's section): the bar shown on every track at once, with its
# locks; a pattern too short is made long enough; a track with no notes is left as it is; one undo puts each track's
# bar back (its length too), the redo pastes again
wait 300
projnew
pat 1 1 32
step 1 1 1 1 100
step 1 1 17 1 100
step 2 1 3 60 100
lock 2 1 3 e1 30
step 3 1 2 48 100
step 3 1 20 50 100
step 4 1 1 62 100
pat 4 1 32
expect trk 1
tap SEQ
listen
tap SEL
row COPY BAR, ALL TRACKS
wait 200
said COPY BAR, ALL TRACKS
tap SEL
wait 100
said COPIED bar 1, all tracks
expect listopen 0
# bar 2 (T1 is 32 steps): T2 and T3 are lengthened to 32, T3's bar 2 replaced, T4's too
tap OCT+
tap SEL
row PASTE BAR, ALL TRACKS
wait 200
said PASTE BAR, ALL TRACKS bar 1
tap SEL
wait 100
said PASTED BAR 4 tracks
expect note 1 1 17 1
expect note 2 1 19 60
expect locks2.1.19 1
expect locks2.1.3 1
expect note 3 1 18 48
expect note 3 1 20 0
expect note 4 1 17 62
expect plen1.1 32
expect plen2.1 32
expect plen3.1 32
expect plen5.1 16
# one undo: every track's bar 2 as it was, T2 and T3 16 steps again, the lock gone from bar 2
listen
press HOME
tap REC
release HOME
wait 50
said UNDO bar 2, all tracks
expect note 2 1 19 0
expect locks2.1.19 0
expect locks2.1.3 1
expect lane 2 1 e1 1
expect note 3 1 18 0
expect note 3 1 20 50
expect note 4 1 17 0
expect note 1 1 1 1
expect plen2.1 16
expect plen3.1 16
expect plen4.1 32
# the redo
press HOME
tap PLAY
release HOME
wait 50
expect note 2 1 19 60
expect locks2.1.19 1
expect note 3 1 20 0
expect plen2.1 32
# from another scene's patterns: a new section, its bar 1 pasted from the copy (scene 1's patterns, read now)
tap OCT-
tap HOME
tap SEL
row NEW SECTION
tap SEL
wait 100
expect scene 2
tap SEQ
step 2 2 3 0
tap SEL
row PASTE BAR, ALL TRACKS
tap SEL
wait 50
expect note 2 2 3 60
expect locks2.2.3 1
expect note 2 1 3 60
